{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10059","headline":"湘灵鼓瑟 · 庄若讷","name":"湘灵鼓瑟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝子鸣金瑟，余声自抑扬。\n悲风丝上断，流水曲中长。\n出没游鱼听，逶迤彩凤翔。\n微音时扣徵，雅韵乍含商。\n神理诚难测，幽情讵可量。\n至今闻古调，应恨滞三湘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庄若讷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10059.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10059","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}